  "description": "Su-ryun, a woman who ate her mother and brother, and believed that bad luck would never end if she was by her side.  \nShe became the crown prince's concubine.\n\n“Just stay by my side.”  \nShe was the one who tried to keep quiet as if she died in the depths of the palace, in case someone would get hurt again.  \nFor some reason, her crown prince, Muheon, keeps extending his bright hand to her.\n\n‘If I hold this hand, can I be happy too? ?'  \nSoo-ryun begins to dream of herself standing next to the prince.\n\nWill her practice be able to rise above her own misfortune and move forward? (GTL)\n\n[Original Web Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/51223352)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58982105), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%99%A9%ED%83%9C%EC%9E%90%EC%9D%98-%EC%B2%A9/2848)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/139462)",
